/ Example newsletter template showing how to use unsubscribe URLs
/ This is just for reference - not a real newsletter template

h1 Newsletter Example

p Here's how you would include an unsubscribe link in your newsletter:

p
  | To unsubscribe from our newsletter, 
  a href="#{newsletter_unsubscribe_url('user@example.com')}" click here
  | .

p Or you can copy and paste this URL into your browser:
p
  code = newsletter_unsubscribe_url('user@example.com')

p
  strong Note: 
  | Replace 'user@example.com' with the actual subscriber's email address when sending newsletters.
